sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager as Project Manager
    participant View as Task View
    participant Controller as TasksController
    participant Service as TaskService
    participant Db as ApplicationDbContext
    Manager->>View: Chọn task và người thực hiện
    View->>Controller: POST Create/Edit
    Controller->>Service: Validate task and assignees
    Service->>Db: Kiểm tra project membership
    Db-->>Service: Eligible users
    Service->>Db: Lưu task assignments
    Db-->>Service: Saved
    Service-->>Controller: Result
    Controller-->>View: Hiển thị kết quả
